 ;; `:map` / `:map-indexed` several-body-forms refusals are withdrawn. No
 ;; head admitted or withdrawn. kotoba-sema's copy lands with its frontend
 ;; in one commit (agent/defn-body-sequences) so no entry is opened for it;
 ;; grammar's entry takes the digest it now needs; kotoba's two stay on
 ;; their own blocker.
 ;;
 ;; 2026-09-12, the map-indexed wave (61b7f728) landed on main as 63dc6e9a
 ;; while the variadic defn wave below was unmerged; the merge of the two
 ;; is 7644f32d, the digest kotoba-sema e4e9521 and amu#971 carry. grammar's
 ;; and kotoba's entries below name 7644f32d as the digest they now need.
 ;;
 ;; 2026-09-12, the variadic defn wave (authority digest 53e4d2f0, after the
 ;; template default binding wave's b957f5cd, which moved the authority
 ;; without touching this file): `:function-semantics :named-multi-arity`
 ;; gains `:variadic-defn` -- the `[fixed ... & rest]` clause the entry always
 ;; claimed, specialized by the fn profile's own lowering per used arity of
 ;; the closed module; exported / value / past-the-bound uses refused by name.
 ;; No head admitted or withdrawn. kotoba-sema's copy lands with its frontend
 ;; in one commit (agent/variadic-defn) so no entry is opened for it;
 ;; grammar's entry takes the digest it now needs; kotoba's two stay on their
 ;; own blocker.
 ;;
 ;; 2026-09-11, the map callback wave (authority digest 11fd920c): `:sugar
 ;; :map` gains `:callback` -- the admitted shapes by name (named / inline /
 ;; closure value / primitive) and eight refusals, one per cause, in place of
 ;; the one sentence `N-source map fn requires matching unique parameters and
 ;; one expression`; the closure-value path REQUESTS its dispatcher. No head
 ;; admitted or withdrawn. kotoba-sema's copy landed with the frontend split
 ;; in one commit (8720979, main 597cda44) BEFORE this authority commit was
 ;; pushed, so its entry was never needed and none is opened; grammar's entry
 ;; takes the digest it now needs; kotoba's two stay on their own blocker.
 ;;
 ;; 2026-09-11, the computed module constant wave (authority digest
 ;; 8450745f, then c308cc04 the same evening): `:core-form-shapes` gains
 ;; `:def` -- a `def` whose value is a pure call form folds at analysis
 ;; time (probed, effect-free, executed once on the reference interpreter,
 ;; the result recorded as the literal); the second step names a quoted
 ;; symbol and an over-long string by their own sentences. No head admitted
 ;; or withdrawn. Recorded the moment the authority moved, before any copy
